        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "Snow on the harbor and lights in every window. Holiday fun! has come to town."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "grandma",
        "expression": "happy",
        "text": "Out came my gingerbread cutters! Gingerbread men and clementine cake, just like when you were small."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "grandma",
        "text": "Tap the Holiday Sleigh for peppermints and clementines. An order of three treats is a Gift order, and folks pay half again for those."
      },
      {
        "speaker": "grandma",
        "expression": "happy",
        "text": "Flour from the Mill and cream and milk from the Fridge, and we're ready to bake."
